 several injured players. The Nuggets came back with strong three-point shooting. Murray tied the game with free throws late in the fourth quarter."], "paragraphs_zh": ["尼古拉·约基奇得到35分、15个篮板和10次助攻。周六晚上，丹佛掘金在加时赛中以141比135击败新奥尔良鹈鹕。贾马尔·穆雷为掘金贡献42分。", "半场结束时，掘金以57比73落后。一些主场球迷对球队发出嘘声。赛后，约基奇表示这些球迷“不再受欢迎”。他说球队从不放弃。", "新秀特雷冯·布拉齐尔在主场首秀中得到17分。他在加时赛中投进一记关键三分球。特雷·墨菲三世以26分领跑鹈鹕。鹈鹕目前已连输三场。", "掘金队有几名受伤球员无法上场。他们凭借精准的三分球完成逆转。穆雷在第四节末段通过罚球追平比分。"], "body": "Nikola Jokić scored 35 points, with 15 rebounds and 10 assists. The Denver Nuggets beat the New Orleans Pelicans 141-135 in overtime on Saturday night. Jamal Murray added 42 points for Denver.\n\nAt half-time, Denver was down 73-57. Some home fans booed the team. After the game, Jokić said those fans are “not welcome” anymore. He said the team never quits.\n\nRookie Trevon Brazille scored 17 points in his home debut. He made a big three-pointer in overtime. Trey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points. The Pelicans have now lost three games.\n\nDenver played without several injured players. The Nuggets came back with strong three-point shooting. Murray tied the game with free throws late in the fourth quarter.", "body_zh": "尼古拉·约基奇得到35分、15个篮板和10次助攻。周六晚上，丹佛掘金在加时赛中以141比135击败新奥尔良鹈鹕。贾马尔·穆雷为掘金贡献42分。\n\n半场结束时，掘金以57比73落后。一些主场球迷对球队发出嘘声。赛后，约基奇表示这些球迷“不再受欢迎”。他说球队从不放弃。\n\n新秀特雷冯·布拉齐尔在主场首秀中得到17分。他在加时赛中投进一记关键三分球。特雷·墨菲三世以26分领跑鹈鹕。鹈鹕目前已连输三场。\n\n掘金队有几名受伤球员无法上场。他们凭借精准的三分球完成逆转。穆雷在第四节末段通过罚球追平比分。", "text": "Nikola Jokić scored 35 points, with 15 rebounds and 10 assists. The Denver Nuggets beat the New Orleans Pelicans 141-135 in overtime on Saturday night. Jamal Murray added 42 points for Denver. At half-time, Denver was down 73-57. Some home fans booed the team. After the game, Jokić said those fans are “not welcome” anymore. He said the team never quits. Rookie Trevon Brazille scored 17 points in his home debut. He made a big three-pointer in overtime. Trey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points. The Pelicans have now lost three games. Denver played without several injured players. The Nuggets came back with strong three-point shooting. Murray tied the game with free throws late in the fourth quarter.", "vocab": [{"word": "comeback", "pos": "noun", "zh": "逆转；翻盘", "note": "常与 from 连用，如 come back from 23 points down", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "overtime", "pos": "noun", "zh": "加时赛", "note": "体育比赛中比分打平后的额外时间", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "boo", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发出嘘声", "note": "球迷表达不满的方式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fan", "pos": "noun", "zh": "球迷；粉丝", "note": "复数 fans", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rebound", "pos": "noun", "zh": "篮板球", "note": "篮球术语，指抢下未进的球", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "assist", "pos": "noun", "zh": "助攻", "note": "帮助队友得分的传球", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rookie", "pos": "noun", "zh": "新秀", "note": "第一年参加职业比赛的球员", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "debut", "pos": "noun", "zh": "首秀；首次登场", "note": "home debut 指主场首秀", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-25T23:27:24.188772", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Nikola", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.675, "sm": 275, "em": 675, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Joki", "s": 0.675, "e": 1.015, "sm": 675, "em": 1015, "cs": 7, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "ć", "s": 1.015, "e": 1.1, "sm": 1015, "em": 1100, "cs": 11, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "scored", "s": 1.1, "e": 1.437, "sm": 1100, "em": 1437, "cs": 13, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "35", "s": 1.438, "e": 2.05, "sm": 1437, "em": 2049, "cs": 20, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "points", "s": 2.05, "e": 2.575, "sm": 2050, "em": 2574, "cs": 23, "ce": 29, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": ",", "s": 2.575, "e": 2.65, "sm": 2575, "em": 2649, "cs": 29, "ce": 30, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "with", "s": 2.65, "e": 2.825, "sm": 2650, "em": 2824, "cs": 31, "ce": 35, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "15", "s": 2.825, "e": 3.25, "sm": 2825, "em": 3249, "cs": 36, "ce": 38, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "rebounds", "s": 3.25, "e": 3.85, "sm": 3250, "em": 3850, "cs": 39, 